<h2 style="color: #06462f; margin-top: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.4px;">Your GoEatOne Administrator Account</h2>
<p style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear <strong><%= typeof name !== 'undefined' && name ? name : 'Administrator' %></strong>,</p>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4B5563; margin: 0 0 18px;">An administrative account has been created for you on the GoEatOne Platform by the Super Administrator.</p>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;">Here are your platform credentials:</p>

<div style="background-color: #f5f8f5; border: 1px solid #deebe3; border-left: 4px solid #ffc629; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; margin: 20px 0 24px;">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #40564b;"><strong>System Access Role:</strong> <span style="color: #06462f; font-weight: bold;"><%= role %></span></p>
  <% if (locals.customRole) { %>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #40564b;"><strong>Permissions Scope:</strong> <span style="color: #06462f; font-weight: bold;"><%= customRole %></span></p>
  <% } %>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #40564b;"><strong>Username / Email:</strong> <span style="color: #06462f; font-weight: bold;"><%= email %></span></p>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #40564b;"><strong>Temporary Password:</strong> <span style="color: #06462f; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; background: #e5ece7; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;"><%= password %></span></p>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4B5563; margin: 0 0 20px;">Please use these details to log in to the admin panel and immediately change your password to secure your account.</p>

<div style="margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align: center;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9CA3AF; margin: 0;">
    Questions or access issues? Contact platform operations at <a href="mailto:support@goeatone.com" style="color: #06462f; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">support@goeatone.com</a>.
  </p>
</div>
